    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλύρ-ιον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], τό</span>, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλύρα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pessary</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.51
			</span></i> (in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλούριον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.1
			</span></i>; used as substitute for a probe, <i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				7.4.4
			</span></i>; <i>pellet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PHolm.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLeid.X.</u>
				69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eye-salve,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Apoc.
				3.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.966.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				177.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; stamped with the physician's seal, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIL</u>
				13.10021.64
			</span></i>, al.: freq. in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.21.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.21.21
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>salve</i> in general, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088
			</span></i> (sg. and pl., <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>):—on 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			 and <i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.23.1
			</span></i>-<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλύρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				12.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fine clay on which a seal can be impressed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. (Freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλούριον</span>,
			as Hp.l.c.(v.l.), <i>PHolm., PLeid.X.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
			</span></i>ll.cc.)</div>
